SUMMARY:Lower Manhattan Walking Tour: Forging the Historic Metropolis
LOCATION:Downtown
DESCRIPTION:A wide-ranging tour exploring 400 years of history and architec
 
ture in Manhattan's oldest settled neighborhood. Walk in the footsteps of G
 
eorge Washington\, Alexander Hamilton\, JP Morgan\, Victoria Woodhull\, and
 
 others on this broad-reaching walk in today's Financial District. Tickets 
 
& info: https://bigonion.com/historic-lower-manhattan-walking-tour/
URL:https://bigonion.com/historic-lower-manhattan-walking-tour/
