SUMMARY:Last Saturdays: Open Classroom
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>Mark your calendars for the last Saturday of every month! Ma
 
y through November\, the Green-House is opening its classroom space for fre
 
e\, drop-in fun for visitors of all ages. Expect two themed hands-on activi
 
ties that will help you explore the art\, history\, or nature of Green-Wood
 
! Each gathering Tickets & info: https://www.green-wood.com/event/last-satu
 
rdays-open-classroom-6/
URL:https://www.green-wood.com/event/last-saturdays-open-classroom-6/
